✖ 2 firing · motel · deploy.example.com · v0.7.0 │ alice@example.… live · 0s ago
help                                                                  esc closes
KEYS OF THE SCREEN BELOW
 enter               open the app
 d                   its newest deploy record if it failed, else the app
 /                   filter by name; /! keeps only marked rows
 s                   sort: attention, name, memory, 5xx
 j k ↑ ↓             move (scroll the log tail on a record)
 PgUp PgDn Home End  move by a page, to the start or the end
 ↑ ↓                 scroll the overlay (with c or y open)
 c                   the motel command for this view
 y                   what the box said, as JSON
 P                   quit and print it (safe on a terminal) (with c or y open)
 ctrl-r              ask the box again now, for what this screen shows
 :                   go to a view (Tab completes)
 esc                 back one screen, or close the overlay; never quits
 ?                   the keys of this screen
 q                   quit

VIEWS (type after :)
 apps                         every app you may view
 status <app>                 one app's overview (also: app <app>)
 deploys <app> [<version>]    one app's deploys, or one record
↑↓ scroll  esc close  q quit
